Me too.  We were not talking about definitions of conduct.  We were 
talking about which conducts are noteworthy and which aren't.  I hardly 
ever break the conduct of not wishing for artifacts.  I have it more or 
less automatically, but not because I want to play a conduct but just 
because there is hardly ever a need to wish for an artifact.

> With your
> definition wishing, polypiling and other NH conducts would not count
